[[File:Anchovies detail.png|left|100px]]
'''Anchovies''' are a type of [[fish]] that restores 1 [[Hitpoints|Hitpoint]] when eaten. It can be obtained by cooking [[raw anchovies]] on a [[fire]] or [[cooking range]], granting 30 experience when successful. When cooking there is a chance to fail, resulting in [[burnt anchovies]]. The burn rate decreases as the player's [[Cooking]] level increases. Anchovies are one of a number of foods with a reduced burn rate while using the [[Cooking range (Lumbridge Castle)|Lumbridge Castle range]] with [[Cook's Assistant]] completed. It will stop burning entirely at Cooking level 34, or 31 when using the Lumbridge range.

Anchovies are an ingredient in [[anchovy pizza]]s, and are also used in the creation of [[impling jar]]s.

